If cos(ep,ffn) and cos(ift,ffn) -> 1 as gamma->0: small-gamma correspondence
holds and EP is faithful. If cos(ep,ift) stays ~1 but both drift from ffn:
EP tracks IFT but the small-gamma limit isn't reached. If cos(ep,ift)<1:
EP relaxation under-converged (raise budget).
